## 🧩 Monitoring Node

Each monitoring node consists of:

| Component                     | Function                                 |
| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| **ESP32**                     | Data acquisition, processing and control |
| **ACS712**                    | Current measurement                      |
| **ZMPT101B**                  | Voltage measurement                      |
| **SX1278 LoRa**               | Wireless communication                   |
| **Relay Module**              | Section isolation                        |
| **Energy Harvesting Circuit** | Node power generation                    |

The modular architecture allows individual nodes to be deployed at different points along the distribution network.

