## 🧪 Prototype

The initial prototype uses a **scaled-down low-voltage setup** to validate the sensing, control, and communication architecture safely.

### Prototype Configuration

```text
5V DC Supply
     │
     ▼
   Relay
     │
     ▼
 Voltage / Current Sensors
     │
     ▼
    ESP32
     │
     ├──── LoRa Communication
     │
     ▼
   Load
(Motor + LED)
```

### Prototype Components

* ESP32 development board
* ACS712 current sensor
* ZMPT101B voltage sensor
* SX1278 LoRa module
* Relay module
* 5V SMPS adapter
* DC motor
* LED load

The low-voltage prototype allows the monitoring and isolation concept to be developed without directly working on an energized LT distribution line.

